Package: pulsaros-spotlight-launcher
Version: 1.0.62
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: gnome-shell
Description: Spotlight launcher extension for Pulsar OS.
 Adds a search icon in the GNOME top bar that runs spotlight-python.
 Fully compatible with GNOME 45-50 and Wayland.
